<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89471" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκαθ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sit down by</i> or <i>near</i>, c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾶκον οὐκ εὐδαίμονα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					895
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>settle</i>, of gadflies or bees, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				31a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				625a14
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Erx.</u>
				397d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Vent.</u>
				61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>settle to the bottom of the vessel</i>, of a mixture, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				15.14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.40
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φυσημάτιον προσεκάθισεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.16.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>sit idle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.167
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sit down before</i> a town, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκαθίσαντα πολιορκεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.12.4
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				12.8.5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
